{"sha": "fa165aa7562d5bfab17e48557a1fa2452f4209181ca6aef6218409bce07f36d3", "body": ["\\section{太阳、地球与温室}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[太阳常数与有效温度]\\label{prop:b2:thermal-radiation:earth}", "太阳（半径 $R_\\odot$、表面温度 $T_\\odot$）在", "距离 $d$ 处的通量密度为 $S = \\sigma T_\\odot^4 (R_\\odot/d)^2 =", "\\qty{1361}{W/m^2}$，即地球大气层外的值（\\emph{太阳", "常数}\\index{太阳常数}）。反照率为 $A$（即被反射的", "比例）的行星吸收 $(1 - A)S\\pi R^2$，并在稳态下将其", "从整个表面 $4\\pi R^2$ 以黑体形式辐射出去，其\\emph{有效", "温度}\\index{有效温度}为", "\\[", "T_{\\text{e}} = \\Big(\\frac{(1 - A)S}{4\\sigma}\\Big)^{1/4} = \\qty{255}{K}", "\\quad\\text{对于地球 } (A = 0.30) .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "能量守恒：吸收量 $= $ 辐射量，", "被截获光束的截面为 $\\pi R^2$，", "辐射则取整个球面（昼夜两侧，经自转与环流均匀化）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.95, >=stealth]", "  % ground", "  \\fill[omExo!15] (0,0) rectangle (8,0.6);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0.6) -- (8,0.6);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (4,0.3) {表面 $T_{\\text{s}}$};", "  % atmosphere layer", "  \\fill[omDef!12] (0,2.6) rectangle (8,3.0);", "  \\draw (0,2.6) -- (8,2.6); \\draw (0,3.0) -- (8,3.0);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (4.3,2.8) {大气层 $T_{\\text{a}}$};", "  % solar in", "  \\draw[->, yellow!60!orange, very thick] (1.2,4.3) -- (1.2,0.7);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, yellow!50!orange, left] at (1.1,3.8) {$(1 - A)S/4$};", "  % surface up", "  \\draw[->, omThm, very thick] (3.2,0.7) -- (3.2,2.5);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omThm, right] at (3.25,1.6) {$\\sigma T_{\\text{s}}^4$};", "  % atm up & down", "  \\draw[->, omDef, very thick] (5.4,3.1) -- (5.4,4.3);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, right] at (5.45,3.8) {$\\sigma T_{\\text{a}}^4$};", "  \\draw[->, omDef, very thick] (6.8,2.5) -- (6.8,0.7);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, right] at (6.85,1.6) {$\\sigma T_{\\text{a}}^4$};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (4,4.6) {太空};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 单层温室：阳光穿过大气层，加热地面；", "地面发出的红外线被该层吸收，该层向上、向下各辐射一半——", "因此地表必须辐射的功率，是其从太阳接收功率的", "两倍。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[单层温室模型]\\label{prop:b2:thermal-radiation:greenhouse}", "用一层薄大气层包围行星，该大气层对太阳光透明，", "但吸收地表发出的全部红外线，并且", "在上下两侧均以温度 $T_{\\text{a}}$ 作为黑体辐射。", "在稳态下，", "\\[", "T_{\\text{a}} = T_{\\text{e}}, \\qquad", "T_{\\text{s}} = 2^{1/4}\\,T_{\\text{e}} = \\qty{303}{K} .", "\\]", "若大气层只吸收红外线中比例为 $\\varepsilon$ 的部分，", "则 $T_{\\text{s}}^4 = T_{\\text{e}}^4/(1 - \\varepsilon/2)$；观测值", "\\qty{288}{K} 对应 $\\varepsilon \\approx 0.78$。地表比有效温度更暖，", "是因为它除接收太阳辐射外，还接收", "大气层向下回送的红外线——即", "\\emph{温室效应}\\index{温室效应}，在地球上约为 \\qty{33}{K}，", "若没有它，海洋便会冻结。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "大气层的平衡：吸收 $\\sigma T_{\\text{s}}^4$，辐射 $2\\sigma", "T_{\\text{a}}^4$。从太空看行星的平衡：辐射 $\\sigma", "T_{\\text{a}}^4 = (1 - A)S/4 = \\sigma T_{\\text{e}}^4$。地表的平衡：", "接收 $(1 - A)S/4 + \\sigma T_{\\text{a}}^4 = 2\\sigma T_{\\text{e}}^4$，", "辐射 $\\sigma T_{\\text{s}}^4$。对于部分透明的大气层，将所吸收与辐射的红外线分别替换为", "$\\varepsilon\\sigma T_{\\text{s}}^4$ 与", "$\\varepsilon\\sigma T_{\\text{a}}^4$，并令", "地表辐射中比例为 $1 - \\varepsilon$ 的部分直接逸出。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[width=9.6cm, height=5cm, xmode=log, xmin=0.1, xmax=100, ymin=0, ymax=1.15,", "    axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={$\\lambda$ (\\unit{\\micro m})}, ylabel={$M_\\lambda$ (归一化)},", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.12)}, anchor=north},", "    xtick={0.1,1,10,100}, xticklabels={$0.1$,$1$,$10$,$100$}, ytick=\\empty, clip=false,", "    legend style={font=\\scriptsize, at={(0.02,0.97)}, anchor=north west, draw=none, fill=none}]", "    \\fill[omDef!10] (axis cs:5,0) rectangle (axis cs:8,1.0);", "    \\fill[omDef!10] (axis cs:14,0) rectangle (axis cs:17,1.0);", "    \\fill[gray!10] (axis cs:2.6,0) rectangle (axis cs:2.9,1.0);", "    \\addplot[yellow!60!orange, thick, domain=0.1:8, samples=200] {4.4*x^(-5)/(exp(14388/(x*5800))-1)};", "    \\addlegendentry{太阳，\\qty{5800}{K}}", "    \\addplot[omExo, thick, domain=2.5:100, samples=200] {1.41e7*x^(-5)/(exp(14388/(x*288))-1)};", "    \\addlegendentry{地球，\\qty{288}{K}}", "    \\node[font=\\tiny, omDef, anchor=south] at (axis cs:6.3,1.0) {H$_2$O};", "    \\node[font=\\tiny, omDef, anchor=south] at (axis cs:15.5,1.0) {CO$_2$};", "    \\node[font=\\tiny, anchor=south] at (axis cs:10.5,0.2) {窗口};", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 太阳与地球的光谱（各自按其峰值归一化）", "几乎不重叠：大气层可以对其中一者透明而对另一者不透明。阴影部分为", "主要红外吸收带，即水蒸气与二氧化碳的吸收带；二者之间的", "\\qty{8}{}--\\qty{13}{\\micro m} 窗口允许地表", "直接向太空辐射。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[为什么温室具有选择性]\\label{rem:b2:thermal-radiation:selective}", "阳光在 \\qty{0.5}{\\micro m} 处达到峰值，地球辐射则在", "\\qty{10}{\\micro m} 处达到峰值：两者光谱几乎不重叠，因此气体可", "对前者透明而对后者吸收。氮气与氧气都不吸收；", "水蒸气、二氧化碳、甲烷与臭氧在红外区有振动吸收带，", "它们是温室气体。", "在 \\qty{8}{} 与 \\qty{13}{\\micro m} 之间的窗口，正是热像仪", "借以观测的波段，也正是夜空 \\qty{250}{K} 所指的，以及", "辐射制冷涂料所利用的窗口。真正温室的玻璃也", "如此（对 \\qty{0.5}{\\micro m} 透明，对 \\qty{10}{\\micro m} 不透明），", "但它主要阻挡对流——“温室”这一名称其实有些不妥。", "\\end{remark}", ""]}